    "detailed_description": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Story]</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597450/extras/0f78d5944eb6570ad5aa059149ccc85c.avif?t=1709168105\" width=496 height=279 /></span><br>&quot;You, there's something sweet... and delicious about your scent.&quot;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597450/extras/ff1c05bdc70808512721b5349078f1e7.avif?t=1709168105\" width=496 height=279 /></span><br>In a twist of fate far from an inheritance, &quot;you&quot; find yourself burdened with sudden debt. Just when all seems lost, an opportunity arises that could turn your life around. <br>The catch? You must survive a detention center where vampires that have lost all control are imprisoned...<br><br>In the vampire's lair, will &quot;your&quot; future be fraught with danger, or could there possibly be a chance for romance?<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Character]</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597450/extras/44f2f4d5cb8b071ef729c9fbdf871739.avif?t=1709168105\" width=279 height=279 /></span><br>The dangerously sexy head vampire of noble lineage, &quot;Dayn&quot;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597450/extras/59c28b7c776f981b7d1084bfcf617d02.avif?t=1709168105\" width=279 height=279 /></span><br>The kind-hearted half-vampire who sees himself as a monster, &quot;Gray&quot;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597450/extras/aa24f5bd07265e94ecab2b749c74a796.avif?t=1709168105\" width=279 height=279 /></span><br>The vampire with a complex about his origins, mysteriously adorable, &quot;Ruel&quot;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597450/extras/a6a7e525a3d745af8462401ca063b041.avif?t=1709168105\" width=279 height=279 /></span><br>Dayn's right-hand man, a loyal vampire, &quot;Eden&quot;<br><br>- Embark on a genuine otome romance simulation game where 'your' choices determine the ending.<br>- Dive into a female-oriented visual novel where your decisions unfold unique storylines with four men.<br>- In BloodKiss, you are the protagonist. Craft your own love story.<br>- With over 200 choices, explore each character's ending, special illustrations, and hidden finales.<br>- Begin your perilous yet romantic dates with these four men today.",
